1
00:00:09,854 --> 00:00:11,188
<font color="white">她的情况如何？</font><font color="white"></font>

2
00:00:13,107 --> 00:00:14,942
<font color="white">好像平静下来了</font><font color="white"></font>

3
00:00:15,526 --> 00:00:20,364
<font color="white">确切来说是因为太过震惊</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">还没整理好想法</font></font><font color="white"></font>

4
00:00:20,448 --> 00:00:22,324
<font color="white">我想也是</font><font color="white"></font>

5
00:00:22,908 --> 00:00:25,244
<font color="white">你为什么不全说出来？</font><font color="white"></font>

6
00:00:26,287 --> 00:00:30,291
<font color="white">我原本就知道得不多</font><font color="white"></font>

7
00:00:30,374 --> 00:00:33,127
<font color="white">而且她一旦跟我们扯上关系</font><font color="white"></font>

8
00:00:33,210 --> 00:00:35,796
<font color="white">她的命运一定会改变</font><font color="white"></font>

9
00:00:36,672 --> 00:00:40,843
<font color="white">我再也不想造成那样的契机了</font><font color="white"></font>

10
00:00:44,221 --> 00:00:45,890
<font color="white">你担心过头了啦</font><font color="white"></font>

11
00:00:54,523 --> 00:00:56,025
<font color="white">玲奈小姐？</font><font color="white"></font>

12
00:00:56,108 --> 00:00:57,193
<font color="white">怎么不在？</font><font color="white"></font>

13
00:01:06,994 --> 00:01:09,371
<font color="white">那个人真是的</font><font color="white"></font>

14
00:01:09,455 --> 00:01:10,915
{\an8}<font color="white">（谢谢你们为我做的事 玲奈）</font><font color="white"></font>

15
00:02:39,587 --> 00:02:41,005
<font color="white">机动奥特曼 最终季</font><font color="white"></font>

16
00:02:47,928 --> 00:02:49,138
<font color="white">刚刚那是什么？</font><font color="white"></font>

17
00:02:52,224 --> 00:02:55,144
<font color="white">你确实赢了赌注</font><font color="white"></font>

18
00:02:55,227 --> 00:02:56,604
<font color="white">我就承认这点吧</font><font color="white"></font>

19
00:02:57,104 --> 00:02:59,398
<font color="white">然后把自己当作诱饵</font><font color="white"></font>

20
00:02:59,481 --> 00:03:02,026
<font color="white">-奥特曼？</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">-证明同伴清白的行动</font></font><font color="white"></font>

21
00:03:02,109 --> 00:03:03,485
<font color="white">也让我陶醉</font><font color="white"></font>

22
00:03:03,986 --> 00:03:05,487
<font color="white">-但是呢…</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">-怎么办？</font></font><font color="white"></font>

23
00:03:06,196 --> 00:03:09,408
<font color="white">这场战斗是我们赢了</font><font color="white"></font>

24
00:03:09,491 --> 00:03:12,995
<font color="white">但还是先把首要目标的你解决掉吧</font><font color="white"></font>

25
00:03:13,078 --> 00:03:14,371
<font color="white">进次郎！</font><font color="white"></font>

26
00:03:14,455 --> 00:03:16,373
<font color="white">你可别恨我哦</font><font color="white"></font>

27
00:03:20,836 --> 00:03:23,213
<font color="white">这是什么？</font><font color="white"></font>

28
00:03:39,939 --> 00:03:41,065
<font color="white">什么？</font><font color="white"></font>

29
00:03:41,649 --> 00:03:42,566
<font color="white">是奥特曼？</font><font color="white"></font>

30
00:03:44,735 --> 00:03:47,696
<font color="white">刚才那是斯派修姆之光？</font><font color="white"></font>

31
00:03:48,614 --> 00:03:49,657
<font color="white">不会吧</font><font color="white"></font>

32
00:03:54,870 --> 00:03:57,373
<font color="white">我不会让你妨碍我们！</font><font color="white"></font>

33
00:04:00,251 --> 00:04:01,877
<font color="white">-太郎先生！</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">-好！</font></font><font color="white"></font>

34
00:04:16,684 --> 00:04:17,518
<font color="white">真的假的？</font><font color="white"></font>

35
00:04:19,019 --> 00:04:20,396
<font color="white">那是我做的？</font><font color="white"></font>

36
00:04:23,649 --> 00:04:24,900
<font color="white">这家伙就是…</font><font color="white"></font>

37
00:04:53,637 --> 00:04:55,806
<font color="white">你再做什么都是白费力气</font><font color="white"></font>

38
00:04:57,099 --> 00:05:00,352
<font color="white">快把你们做的事情公诸于世</font><font color="white"></font>

39
00:05:00,436 --> 00:05:01,645
<font color="white">只要那么做…</font><font color="white"></font>

40
00:05:02,229 --> 00:05:05,357
<font color="white">大家对奥特曼的怀疑就会消失？</font><font color="white"></font>

41
00:05:05,441 --> 00:05:07,026
<font color="white">真的是那样吗？</font><font color="white"></font>

42
00:05:07,109 --> 00:05:08,402
<font color="white">你想说什么？</font><font color="white"></font>

43
00:05:09,695 --> 00:05:13,782
<font color="white">梅菲斯特的目的和我并不相同</font><font color="white"></font>

44
00:05:14,575 --> 00:05:17,870
<font color="white">那家伙的计划接下来才要开始</font><font color="white"></font>

45
00:05:18,454 --> 00:05:21,373
<font color="white">那样的话我们就阻止他</font><font color="white"></font>

46
00:05:22,791 --> 00:05:25,294
<font color="white">你叫什么名字？</font><font color="white"></font>

47
00:05:25,794 --> 00:05:28,339
<font color="white">我叫太郎 奥特曼太郎</font><font color="white"></font>

48
00:05:28,881 --> 00:05:30,424
<font color="white">真是个好名字</font><font color="white"></font>

49
00:05:38,766 --> 00:05:40,684
<font color="white">那么再见啦</font><font color="white"></font>

50
00:05:40,768 --> 00:05:42,936
<font color="white">之后在某处相见吧</font><font color="white"></font>

51
00:05:44,772 --> 00:05:45,814
<font color="white">可恶</font><font color="white"></font>

52
00:05:46,523 --> 00:05:48,776
<font color="white">太郎先生 多亏有你帮忙</font><font color="white"></font>

53
00:05:49,610 --> 00:05:52,821
<font color="white">不过没想到</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">连诸星先生的冒牌货都存在</font></font><font color="white"></font>

54
00:05:53,822 --> 00:05:55,741
<font color="white">我明明有想到这点</font><font color="white"></font>

55
00:05:55,824 --> 00:05:57,993
<font color="white">这是我的错 抱歉</font><font color="white"></font>

56
00:05:59,203 --> 00:06:01,747
<font color="white">比起这个 刚才发生的事</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">是我想的那样吗？</font></font><font color="white"></font>

57
00:06:03,290 --> 00:06:04,416
<font color="white">是啊</font><font color="white"></font>

58
00:06:33,570 --> 00:06:36,198
<font color="white">那确实是奥特曼</font><font color="white"></font>

59
00:06:37,699 --> 00:06:39,868
<font color="white">到底是谁呢？</font><font color="white"></font>

60
00:06:40,619 --> 00:06:43,580
<font color="white">-搞不好…</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">-怎么了？</font></font><font color="white"></font>

61
00:06:44,581 --> 00:06:46,208
<font color="white">那就是最后一人</font><font color="white"></font>

62
00:06:48,210 --> 00:06:50,045
<font color="white">第四个奥特曼？</font><font color="white"></font>

63
00:06:50,587 --> 00:06:51,421
<font color="white">对</font><font color="white"></font>

64
00:06:51,922 --> 00:06:54,424
<font color="white">关于那件事你们迟早会知道</font><font color="white"></font>

65
00:06:55,259 --> 00:06:56,093
<font color="white">大家好</font><font color="white"></font>

66
00:06:56,635 --> 00:06:57,803
<font color="white">杰克先生</font><font color="white"></font>

67
00:06:57,886 --> 00:07:01,348
<font color="white">我经过附近时听到很大的声响</font><font color="white"></font>

68
00:07:01,932 --> 00:07:06,103
<font color="white">就马上赶过来</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">不过好像已经打完架了</font></font><font color="white"></font>

69
00:07:12,526 --> 00:07:16,155
<font color="white">你以为用这招我们每次都会上当吗？</font><font color="white"></font>

70
00:07:16,238 --> 00:07:18,449
<font color="white">杰克现在人在美国</font><font color="white"></font>

71
00:07:22,661 --> 00:07:25,456
<font color="white">真痛啊 这拳真是狠</font><font color="white"></font>

72
00:07:28,834 --> 00:07:30,419
<font color="white">是真的杰克先生</font><font color="white"></font>

73
00:07:35,424 --> 00:07:36,592
<font color="white">爸</font><font color="white"></font>

74
00:07:39,845 --> 00:07:42,389
<font color="white">-玲奈 你来了啊</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">-你还好吗？</font></font><font color="white"></font>

75
00:07:48,270 --> 00:07:50,647
<font color="white">抱歉让你担心了</font><font color="white"></font>

76
00:07:51,482 --> 00:07:55,194
<font color="white">而且太小题大作了</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">我没严重到得谢绝会客</font></font><font color="white"></font>

77
00:07:58,739 --> 00:08:00,240
<font color="white">太好了</font><font color="white"></font>

78
00:08:02,409 --> 00:08:05,996
<font color="white">话说回来 有件事我想请你说明</font><font color="white"></font>

79
00:08:06,872 --> 00:08:08,665
<font color="white">我也不知道</font><font color="white"></font>

80
00:08:08,749 --> 00:08:12,794
<font color="white">-奥特曼突然将我…</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">-不对 不是那件事</font></font><font color="white"></font>

81
00:08:13,504 --> 00:08:14,838
<font color="white">我是指这件事情</font><font color="white"></font>

82
00:08:22,137 --> 00:08:25,474
<font color="white">玲奈 你…到底发生了什么事？</font><font color="white"></font>

83
00:08:27,601 --> 00:08:31,063
<font color="white">听说这是某个人为了我</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">而命令其他人制作的</font></font><font color="white"></font>

84
00:08:32,189 --> 00:08:35,192
<font color="white">就在我原本的力量觉醒之前</font><font color="white"></font>

85
00:08:38,487 --> 00:08:40,280
<font color="white">原本的力量是指什么？</font><font color="white"></font>

86
00:08:40,822 --> 00:08:44,284
<font color="white">这该不会跟妈妈的死有关吧？</font><font color="white"></font>

87
00:08:53,669 --> 00:08:56,213
<font color="white">好了 别这样</font><font color="white"></font>

88
00:08:56,296 --> 00:08:57,506
<font color="white">好痛啊</font><font color="white"></font>

89
00:09:05,847 --> 00:09:07,099
<font color="white">告诉我吧</font><font color="white"></font>

90
00:09:09,059 --> 00:09:11,979
<font color="white">我出生的时候发生了什么事？</font><font color="white"></font>

91
00:09:13,397 --> 00:09:14,565
<font color="white">爸！</font><font color="white"></font>

92
00:09:19,194 --> 00:09:20,612
<font color="white">我知道了</font><font color="white"></font>

93
00:09:35,043 --> 00:09:37,671
<font color="white">你是科学特搜队的人吧？</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">这是你干的吗？</font></font><font color="white"></font>

94
00:09:37,754 --> 00:09:38,880
<font color="white">不是我做的</font><font color="white"></font>

95
00:09:39,506 --> 00:09:42,509
<font color="white">杀害事件的证人对我有什么好处？</font><font color="white"></font>

96
00:09:42,593 --> 00:09:45,846
<font color="white">是这家伙的同伴为了封口而杀掉的</font><font color="white"></font>

97
00:09:47,764 --> 00:09:50,475
<font color="white">你要怎么处置我？</font><font color="white"></font>

98
00:09:50,559 --> 00:09:51,768
<font color="white">随你高兴</font><font color="white"></font>

99
00:09:53,312 --> 00:09:55,188
<font color="white">看是要等着被我消灭…</font><font color="white"></font>

100
00:09:59,401 --> 00:10:02,070
<font color="white">还是将所有事情都向我交代清楚</font><font color="white"></font>

101
00:10:08,952 --> 00:10:13,206
<font color="white">我找到了第四位奥特曼</font><font color="white"></font>

102
00:10:13,999 --> 00:10:15,250
<font color="white">看来是那样呢</font><font color="white"></font>

103
00:10:16,877 --> 00:10:20,505
<font color="white">多亏了你 万事俱备了</font><font color="white"></font>

104
00:10:22,341 --> 00:10:24,092
<font color="white">我必须谢谢你</font><font color="white"></font>

105
00:10:26,053 --> 00:10:27,512
<font color="white">是这样吗？</font><font color="white"></font>

106
00:10:27,596 --> 00:10:31,516
<font color="white">那该不会代表我已经没用处了吧？</font><font color="white"></font>

107
00:10:33,393 --> 00:10:35,395
<font color="white">你的观察力真敏锐</font><font color="white"></font>

108
00:10:54,706 --> 00:10:55,874
<font color="white">我们回来了</font><font color="white"></font>

109
00:10:56,500 --> 00:10:58,085
<font color="white">好久不见</font><font color="white"></font>

110
00:11:03,256 --> 00:11:04,424
<font color="white">井手先生</font><font color="white"></font>

111
00:11:04,508 --> 00:11:05,967
<font color="white">伊多先生</font><font color="white"></font>

112
00:11:06,051 --> 00:11:07,219
<font color="white">进次郎</font><font color="white"></font>

113
00:11:11,139 --> 00:11:12,391
<font color="white">对不起</font><font color="white"></font>

114
00:11:12,891 --> 00:11:14,768
<font color="white">抬起头来 进次郎</font><font color="white"></font>

115
00:11:15,394 --> 00:11:17,354
<font color="white">该道歉的是我们才对</font><font color="white"></font>

116
00:11:18,438 --> 00:11:19,481
<font color="white">可是…</font><font color="white"></font>

117
00:11:19,564 --> 00:11:23,151
<font color="white">我们应该要相信你到最后一刻</font><font color="white"></font>

118
00:11:24,027 --> 00:11:25,779
<font color="white">真的很抱歉</font><font color="white"></font>

119
00:11:26,571 --> 00:11:27,697
<font color="white">没关系</font><font color="white"></font>

120
00:11:29,616 --> 00:11:31,910
<font color="white">虽然说我爸被杀了</font><font color="white"></font>

121
00:11:31,993 --> 00:11:34,579
<font color="white">我也不该独自肆意乱来</font><font color="white"></font>

122
00:11:34,663 --> 00:11:36,832
<font color="white">不是这样的 进次郎</font><font color="white"></font>

123
00:11:37,624 --> 00:11:41,169
<font color="white">我不认为早田被杀害了</font><font color="white"></font>

124
00:11:41,753 --> 00:11:44,256
<font color="white">那家伙一定还活着</font><font color="white"></font>

125
00:11:45,132 --> 00:11:50,178
<font color="white">总之接下来我们只需要</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">团结一心并粉碎敌人的计谋就行了</font></font><font color="white"></font>

126
00:11:50,929 --> 00:11:52,681
<font color="white">是那样吗？</font><font color="white"></font>

127
00:11:54,641 --> 00:11:57,018
<font color="white">你说的“敌人的计谋”是什么？</font><font color="white"></font>

128
00:11:57,102 --> 00:11:59,855
<font color="white">话说“敌人”又是指谁？</font><font color="white"></font>

129
00:12:01,189 --> 00:12:02,482
<font color="white">什么意思？</font><font color="white"></font>

130
00:12:03,150 --> 00:12:05,694
<font color="white">你是说那些人不是真正的敌人吗？</font><font color="white"></font>

131
00:12:06,736 --> 00:12:08,864
<font color="white">你掌握了一些线索</font><font color="white"></font>

132
00:12:10,991 --> 00:12:13,160
<font color="white">是这个意思吧？</font><font color="white"></font>

133
00:12:13,952 --> 00:12:17,372
<font color="white">不 我还没掌握全貌</font><font color="white"></font>

134
00:12:17,456 --> 00:12:20,625
<font color="white">不过我逐渐能看清敌人真正的目的了</font><font color="white"></font>

135
00:12:21,168 --> 00:12:25,922
<font color="white">那群人不只是想陷害进次郎</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">并试图将他逼入绝境</font></font><font color="white"></font>

136
00:12:27,424 --> 00:12:31,303
<font color="white">他们想让你成为真正的灾害</font><font color="white"></font>

137
00:12:32,929 --> 00:12:34,097
<font color="white">我吗？</font><font color="white"></font>

138
00:12:37,517 --> 00:12:39,060
<font color="white">我本来觉得迟早</font><font color="white"></font>

139
00:12:39,895 --> 00:12:42,731
<font color="white">都得将原委要好好告诉你</font><font color="white"></font>

140
00:12:46,860 --> 00:12:48,737
<font color="white">你母亲啊</font><font color="white"></font>

141
00:12:50,864 --> 00:12:52,157
<font color="white">是外星人</font><font color="white"></font>

142
00:12:56,328 --> 00:12:57,662
<font color="white">不会吧</font><font color="white"></font>

143
00:13:01,625 --> 00:13:03,835
<font color="white">这就是为什么我问你关于妈妈的事情</font><font color="white"></font>

144
00:13:03,919 --> 00:13:06,505
<font color="white">你也都不告诉我啊</font><font color="white"></font>

145
00:13:09,966 --> 00:13:12,260
<font color="white">我刚认识她的时候也不知道</font><font color="white"></font>

146
00:13:13,637 --> 00:13:17,098
<font color="white">我也是在你出生时才晓得真相</font><font color="white"></font>

147
00:13:18,183 --> 00:13:22,395
<font color="white">不过她生下你不久后</font><font color="white"></font>

148
00:13:22,479 --> 00:13:24,147
<font color="white">身体状况就恶化…</font><font color="white"></font>

149
00:13:26,816 --> 00:13:27,984
<font color="white">因此去世了</font><font color="white"></font>

150
00:13:29,694 --> 00:13:33,073
<font color="white">那么我过去所相信的…</font><font color="white"></font>

151
00:13:34,199 --> 00:13:37,744
<font color="white">母亲生下我后随即逝世</font><font color="white"></font>

152
00:13:38,703 --> 00:13:42,123
<font color="white">她被超人奥特曼和外星人的战斗波及</font><font color="white"></font>

153
00:13:42,999 --> 00:13:45,502
<font color="white">受困在倒塌的医院…</font><font color="white"></font>

154
00:13:46,711 --> 00:13:48,088
<font color="white">身亡</font><font color="white"></font>

155
00:13:49,798 --> 00:13:51,216
<font color="white">那都是谎言吗？</font><font color="white"></font>

156
00:13:53,176 --> 00:13:56,805
<font color="white">她被卷入奥特曼</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">与外星人的战斗所引起的事故中</font></font><font color="white"></font>

157
00:13:57,556 --> 00:13:58,932
<font color="white">受了十分严重的伤</font><font color="white"></font>

158
00:14:00,183 --> 00:14:01,810
<font color="white">那是真的</font><font color="white"></font>

159
00:14:02,894 --> 00:14:05,021
<font color="white">她被收治于这间医院</font><font color="white"></font>

160
00:14:05,105 --> 00:14:07,357
<font color="white">仍然决定要生下你</font><font color="white"></font>

161
00:14:07,440 --> 00:14:09,526
<font color="white">然后太过勉强自己</font><font color="white"></font>

162
00:14:10,777 --> 00:14:12,737
<font color="white">为了生下我？</font><font color="white"></font>

163
00:14:12,821 --> 00:14:14,781
<font color="white">这是她的愿望</font><font color="white"></font>

164
00:14:16,741 --> 00:14:19,202
<font color="white">而且也是我的愿望</font><font color="white"></font>

165
00:14:21,037 --> 00:14:24,457
<font color="white">所以我只能跟你那样解释</font><font color="white"></font>

166
00:14:25,500 --> 00:14:29,504
<font color="white">都是为了保护你的外星人母亲和你</font><font color="white"></font>

167
00:14:33,300 --> 00:14:34,384
<font color="white">妈妈…</font><font color="white"></font>

168
00:14:43,685 --> 00:14:44,728
<font color="white">不过…</font><font color="white"></font>

169
00:14:45,437 --> 00:14:48,023
<font color="white">把错全怪罪在奥特曼身上</font><font color="white"></font>

170
00:14:48,648 --> 00:14:49,816
<font color="white">太过分了</font><font color="white"></font>

171
00:14:55,113 --> 00:14:57,866
<font color="white">你说得很对</font><font color="white"></font>

172
00:15:01,578 --> 00:15:03,121
<font color="white">抱歉</font><font color="white"></font>

173
00:15:03,204 --> 00:15:05,123
<font color="white">我想一个人静一静</font><font color="white"></font>

174
00:15:05,206 --> 00:15:06,333
<font color="white">玲奈？</font><font color="white"></font>

175
00:15:19,679 --> 00:15:22,182
<font color="white">让我成为真正的灾害？</font><font color="white"></font>

176
00:15:23,224 --> 00:15:24,601
<font color="white">这是什么意思？</font><font color="white"></font>

177
00:15:25,352 --> 00:15:27,938
<font color="white">他们破坏城市、伤害地球人</font><font color="white"></font>

178
00:15:29,439 --> 00:15:31,191
<font color="white">让奥特曼彼此之间对立</font><font color="white"></font>

179
00:15:31,858 --> 00:15:33,902
<font color="white">使人们不再信任奥特曼</font><font color="white"></font>

180
00:15:34,861 --> 00:15:38,156
<font color="white">他们那样把我们逼入绝境是事实</font><font color="white"></font>

181
00:15:39,032 --> 00:15:41,534
<font color="white">不过那是他们</font><font color="white"></font>

182
00:15:41,618 --> 00:15:43,578
<font color="white">使用冒牌货进行的阴谋</font><font color="white"></font>

183
00:15:43,662 --> 00:15:47,582
<font color="white">只要知道真相</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">就会知道一切都是造假</font></font><font color="white"></font>

184
00:15:48,792 --> 00:15:52,379
<font color="white">这代表他们的目的不仅于此</font><font color="white"></font>

185
00:15:53,880 --> 00:15:57,342
<font color="white">井手先生 能打扰一下吗？</font><font color="white"></font>

186
00:15:57,968 --> 00:16:00,303
<font color="white">-怎么了？</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">-那名教授又来了</font></font><font color="white"></font>

187
00:16:01,471 --> 00:16:03,682
<font color="white">（快报 奥特曼的真相）</font><font color="white"></font>

188
00:16:03,765 --> 00:16:05,183
<font color="white">各位请看</font><font color="white"></font>

189
00:16:05,266 --> 00:16:09,270
<font color="white">他们的真实面目在此刻终于显露</font><font color="white"></font>

190
00:16:11,356 --> 00:16:16,611
<font color="white">长久以来奥特曼</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">让我们误以为他们是盟友</font></font><font color="white"></font>

191
00:16:16,695 --> 00:16:18,905
<font color="white">而这才是真正的奥特曼</font><font color="white"></font>

192
00:16:20,281 --> 00:16:21,449
<font color="white">到目前为止</font><font color="white"></font>

193
00:16:21,533 --> 00:16:25,495
<font color="white">他们都装成是对这颗地球有益的英雄</font><font color="white"></font>

194
00:16:26,162 --> 00:16:31,251
<font color="white">不过其本质对宇宙来说只是个灾害</font><font color="white"></font>

195
00:16:31,751 --> 00:16:33,420
<font color="white">现在还不迟</font><font color="white"></font>

196
00:16:33,503 --> 00:16:35,714
<font color="white">现在正是我们要清醒的时候</font><font color="white"></font>

197
00:16:37,007 --> 00:16:41,177
<font color="white">应该认清我们这些地球人</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">对奥特曼抱持的信仰</font></font><font color="white"></font>

198
00:16:41,720 --> 00:16:43,680
<font color="white">就是个错误</font><font color="white"></font>

199
00:16:43,763 --> 00:16:45,181
<font color="white">什么？</font><font color="white"></font>

200
00:16:45,265 --> 00:16:46,516
<font color="white">所以说奥特曼</font><font color="white"></font>

201
00:16:46,599 --> 00:16:49,602
<font color="white">果然是很危险的一群人？</font><font color="white"></font>

202
00:16:49,686 --> 00:16:52,188
<font color="white">那种人要是随意大闹就真的糟透了</font><font color="white"></font>

203
00:17:03,825 --> 00:17:06,077
<font color="white">对奥特曼的信仰？</font><font color="white"></font>

204
00:17:06,661 --> 00:17:07,829
<font color="white">他在说什么啊？</font><font color="white"></font>

205
00:17:08,496 --> 00:17:10,665
<font color="white">也就是说 他想说的是…</font><font color="white"></font>

206
00:17:11,750 --> 00:17:17,213
<font color="white">奥特曼持续保护地球</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">避免受到外星人等外敌的攻击</font></font><font color="white"></font>

207
00:17:17,714 --> 00:17:19,716
<font color="white">进而成为地球的守护神</font><font color="white"></font>

208
00:17:19,799 --> 00:17:22,302
<font color="white">大家对奥特曼的信赖无法被撼动</font><font color="white"></font>

209
00:17:24,387 --> 00:17:27,474
<font color="white">那名教授将其称为信仰</font><font color="white"></font>

210
00:17:31,978 --> 00:17:33,188
<font color="white">到底怎么了？</font><font color="white"></font>

211
00:17:33,271 --> 00:17:34,522
<font color="white">这个嘛…</font><font color="white"></font>

212
00:17:35,106 --> 00:17:36,316
<font color="white">是谁啊？</font><font color="white"></font>

213
00:17:36,399 --> 00:17:37,692
<font color="white">你们是谁？</font><font color="white"></font>

214
00:17:42,322 --> 00:17:43,865
<font color="white">我们是公安 全都不准动</font><font color="white"></font>

215
00:17:44,908 --> 00:17:47,744
<font color="white">公安警察来这里干吗？</font><font color="white"></font>

216
00:17:49,871 --> 00:17:51,998
<font color="white">你是科学特搜队的井手先生对吧？</font><font color="white"></font>

217
00:17:52,749 --> 00:17:54,876
<font color="white">为了调查这次一连串的事件</font><font color="white"></font>

218
00:17:54,959 --> 00:17:57,295
<font color="white">我们要暂时停止科学特搜队的工作</font><font color="white"></font>

219
00:17:57,378 --> 00:17:59,964
<font color="white">所有人请都跟我走</font><font color="white"></font>

220
00:18:00,048 --> 00:18:01,925
<font color="white">-你说什么？</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">-别这样</font></font><font color="white"></font>

221
00:18:02,801 --> 00:18:06,304
<font color="white">现在只能乖乖照他们的话做</font><font color="white"></font>

222
00:18:12,143 --> 00:18:13,978
<font color="white">给我等一下！</font><font color="white"></font>

223
00:18:14,562 --> 00:18:15,897
<font color="white">你这样我们很困扰</font><font color="white"></font>

224
00:18:15,980 --> 00:18:16,981
<font color="white">玲奈小姐？</font><font color="white"></font>

225
00:18:17,065 --> 00:18:19,192
<font color="white">奥特曼怎么可能是灾害</font><font color="white"></font>

226
00:18:19,275 --> 00:18:21,569
<font color="white">快收回你说的那番话</font><font color="white"></font>

227
00:18:21,653 --> 00:18:23,154
<font color="white">玲奈？</font><font color="white"></font>

228
00:18:23,238 --> 00:18:24,322
<font color="white">原本有她这一段吗？</font><font color="white"></font>

229
00:18:24,405 --> 00:18:25,240
<font color="white">不如说啊</font><font color="white"></font>

230
00:18:25,990 --> 00:18:28,409
<font color="white">单方面在那边斥责的是你才对吧</font><font color="white"></font>

231
00:18:28,493 --> 00:18:32,705
<font color="white">你能证明过去的事件都是</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">真正的奥特曼引起的吗？</font></font><font color="white"></font>

232
00:18:33,289 --> 00:18:35,959
<font color="white">我可是看到了冒牌货</font><font color="white"></font>

233
00:18:36,042 --> 00:18:37,168
<font color="white">冒牌货？</font><font color="white"></font>

234
00:18:37,252 --> 00:18:40,588
<font color="white">我反而想请教你呢</font><font color="white"></font>

235
00:18:40,672 --> 00:18:45,635
<font color="white">为什么你那么支持奥特曼？</font><font color="white"></font>

236
00:18:49,097 --> 00:18:50,974
<font color="white">我来告诉你吧</font><font color="white"></font>

237
00:18:51,057 --> 00:18:55,311
<font color="white">那是因为她就是当事者</font><font color="white"></font>

238
00:18:55,395 --> 00:18:56,855
<font color="white">这是什么？</font><font color="white"></font>

239
00:18:56,938 --> 00:18:58,481
<font color="white">-什么？</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">-摄影机</font></font><font color="white"></font>

240
00:19:08,658 --> 00:19:13,246
<font color="white">我们终于见面了呢 远藤玲奈小姐</font><font color="white"></font>

241
00:19:14,372 --> 00:19:15,456
<font color="white">梅菲斯特</font><font color="white"></font>

242
00:19:17,584 --> 00:19:18,501
<font color="white">玲奈小姐！</font><font color="white"></font>

243
00:19:18,585 --> 00:19:20,086
<font color="white">别让他走</font><font color="white"></font>

244
00:19:29,262 --> 00:19:31,055
<font color="white">暂时先给我乖乖听话吧</font><font color="white"></font>

245
00:19:33,016 --> 00:19:35,059
<font color="white">快去吧 进次郎！</font><font color="white"></font>

246
00:19:35,768 --> 00:19:36,895
<font color="white">太郎先生</font><font color="white"></font>

247
00:19:44,694 --> 00:19:47,113
<font color="white">-抓住他！</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">-去追逃跑的人！</font></font><font color="white"></font>

248
00:20:02,420 --> 00:20:04,005
<font color="white">给我们看看</font><font color="white"></font>

249
00:20:04,797 --> 00:20:07,550
<font color="white">你本来的模样吧</font><font color="white"></font>

250
00:20:07,634 --> 00:20:09,469
<font color="white">他是什么意思？</font><font color="white"></font>

251
00:20:09,552 --> 00:20:11,221
<font color="white">我也不知道</font><font color="white"></font>

252
00:20:12,430 --> 00:20:14,474
<font color="white">你还在犹豫什么？</font><font color="white"></font>

253
00:20:15,058 --> 00:20:17,435
<font color="white">就让我们看一下</font><font color="white"></font>

254
00:20:18,061 --> 00:20:19,979
<font color="white">你本来的模样好吗？</font><font color="white"></font>

255
00:20:36,412 --> 00:20:37,538
<font color="white">那是…</font><font color="white"></font>

256
00:20:40,875 --> 00:20:41,834
<font color="white">玲奈小姐！</font><font color="white"></font>

257
00:20:43,586 --> 00:20:46,422
<font color="white">你来了啊？奥特曼</font><font color="white"></font>

258
00:20:48,758 --> 00:20:49,717
<font color="white">等一下！</font><font color="white"></font>

259
00:20:57,892 --> 00:20:59,811
<font color="white">发生了重大事件</font><font color="white"></font>

260
00:20:59,894 --> 00:21:02,689
<font color="white">做出打倒奥特曼</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">宣言的外星人梅菲斯特</font></font><font color="white"></font>

261
00:21:02,772 --> 00:21:04,315
<font color="white">出现在摄影棚内</font><font color="white"></font>

262
00:21:04,399 --> 00:21:07,610
<font color="white">-掳走了偶像佐山玲奈小姐</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">-这下糟了</font></font><font color="white"></font>

263
00:21:07,694 --> 00:21:10,405
<font color="white">-科学特搜队现在居然得停止工作</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">-到底发生了什么事？</font></font><font color="white"></font>

264
00:21:10,488 --> 00:21:12,782
<font color="white">-我不是指那个</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">-什么意思？</font></font><font color="white"></font>

265
00:21:13,825 --> 00:21:15,243
<font color="white">-不准动！</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">-我不是说了吗？</font></font><font color="white"></font>

266
00:21:16,202 --> 00:21:20,331
<font color="white">他们打算让进次郎成为真正的灾害</font><font color="white"></font>

267
00:21:20,415 --> 00:21:24,168
<font color="white">现在那项计划开始进行了</font><font color="white"></font>

268
00:21:27,630 --> 00:21:29,549
<font color="white">别将玲奈小姐卷进来</font><font color="white"></font>

269
00:21:31,592 --> 00:21:32,969
<font color="white">是那样吗？</font><font color="white"></font>

270
00:21:33,803 --> 00:21:35,179
<font color="white">真有趣</font><font color="white"></font>

271
00:21:41,769 --> 00:21:42,854
<font color="white">来吧</font><font color="white"></font>

272
00:21:43,479 --> 00:21:46,149
<font color="white">想要夺回这女孩的话</font><font color="white"></font>

273
00:21:47,025 --> 00:21:51,863
<font color="white">就释放出你所有的力量吧</font><font color="white"></font>

274
00:22:00,455 --> 00:22:04,667
<font color="white">敌人打算引出</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">潜藏在进次郎内心深处的</font></font><font color="white"></font>

275
00:22:04,751 --> 00:22:07,712
<font color="white">那股真正的力量</font><font color="white"></font>

276
00:22:17,096 --> 00:22:19,432
<font color="white">代表着让进次郎完成</font><font color="white"></font>

277
00:22:20,183 --> 00:22:21,934
<font color="white">光之巨人化</font><font color="white"></font>

278
00:24:06,038 --> 00:24:09,125
<font color="white">字幕翻译：蒋文昊</font><font color="white"></font>

